  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Banking System Strengthening Sector Program</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">Programa Sectorial Fortalecimiento Sistema Bancario</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">El objetivo del presente Programa es apoyar la implantacin de las reformas que est llevando a cabo el gobierno con el objeto de estabilizar la liquidez y solvencia de la banca y restaurar la confianza de los depositantes en el sistema bancario nacional.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The objective of the Program is to support, within a macroeconomic policies framework geared toward long term stable economic growth, the implementation of the reforms being carried out by the Uruguayan Government to restore the solvency and strengthen the safety of the Uruguayan banking system</narrative>
  </description>
